|-
| London depth (superconductor) || <math>\lambda_L = \sqrt{m_e/\mu_0 n_s e^2}</math> || <math>\nabla^2 B = B/\lambda_L^2</math> || Meissner effect || Closest structural analogue — both are Yukawa screening of a field by an effective mass term
|-
